{"strongs": "H4161", "word": "מוֺצָא", "translit": "mo.tsa", "root": "יער", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "place or act of going forth, issue, export, souce, spring", "definition": "I. מוֺצָא noun masculine Hos 6:3 place or act of going forth, issue, export, souce, spring ; — absolute ׳ מ Job 28:1 ; Ps 75:7 construct ׳ מ Num 30:13 + 9 t.; מֹצָא Job 38:27 ; Dan 9:25 suffix מוֺצָאֲךָ 2Sam 3:25 מֹצָאוֺ Hos 6:3 מוֺצָאוֺ Ps 19:7 plural construct מוֺצָאֵי Isa 41:18 + 5 t.; suffix מוֺצָאָיו Ezek 43:11 מוֺצָאֵיהֶם Num 33:2 (twice in verse); מוֺצָאֵיהֶן Ezek 42:11 — 1. a going forth: \\ \\ a. the act, of ׳ י Hos 6:3 of the sun = rising Ps 19:7 (see יצא 1 f ); of man 2Sam 3:25 (opposed to מָבוֺא Kt ); דָּבָר ׳ מ Dan 9:25 going forth of a command. \\ \\ b. concrete, מוֺצָאֵי גּוֺלָה Ezek 12:4 goings forth of exile, i.e. those going forth into exile (in simile). \\ \\ c. way out, exit: concrete, of chambers in temple Ezek 42:11 ; Ezek 43:11 (opposed to מוֺבָאָיו ); מוֺצָאֵי הַמִּקְדָּשׁ Ezek 44:5 (opposed to מְבוֺא הַבַּיִת ). 2. that which goes forth: \\ \\ a. utteranc of mouth or lips (especially of solemn or formal speech), ׳ מוֺצָא פִייֿ Deut 8:3 ׳ שְׂפָתַי מ Jer 17:16 ; Ps 89:35 so Deut 23:24 ; Num 30:13 ( P ). \\ \\ b. export of horses 1Kgs 10:23 = 2Chr 1:16 . 3. place of going forth: \\ \\ a. source or spring of water 2Kgs 2:21 ; Isa 58:11 (in simile) Ps 107:33 (|| נְהָרוֺת ), v Ps 107:35 (|| אֲגַםמֿים ) = Isa 41:18 (|| id. ); מוֺצָא מֵימֵי גִיחוֺן הָעֶלְיוֺן 2Chr 32:30 . \\ \\ b. place of departure of Israel on marchNum 2Chr 33:2 (twice in verse) ( P ). \\ \\ c. מוֺצָא = east (place of sun's going forth) Ps 75:7 (opposed to מַעֲרָב ); zeugmatically, Ps 65:9 מוֺצָאֵי בֹּקֶר וָעֶרֶב i.e. the east and the west (compare the two Orients , Qor 43:37). \\ \\ d. place whence silver comes = mine Job 28:1 וּלְהַצְמִיחַ מֹצָא דֶשֶׁא Job 38:27 and to cause the growing-place (others, the growth ) of young grass to sprout.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3661')\">BDB3661</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4161')\">H4161</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3660')\">BDB3660</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3662')\">BDB3662</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>מוֺצָא</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Hos 6:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,3)\">Hos 6:3</ref></sup> <highlightword>place or act of going forth, issue, export, souce, spring</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 28:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,1)\">Job 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 75:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,7)\">Ps 75:7</ref> construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,13)\">Num 30:13</ref> + 9 t.; <bdbheb>מֹצָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,27)\">Job 38:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:25\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,25)\">Dan 9:25</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֲךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:25\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,25)\">2Sam 3:25</ref> <bdbheb>מֹצָאוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 6:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,3)\">Hos 6:3</ref> <bdbheb>מוֺצָאוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 19:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,7)\">Ps 19:7</ref> plural construct <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,18)\">Isa 41:18</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מוֺצָאָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,11)\">Ezek 43:11</ref><bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 33:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,2)\">Num 33:2</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵיהֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,11)\">Ezek 42:11</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>a going forth:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> the act, of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 6:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,3)\">Hos 6:3</ref> of the sun = <highlight>rising</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 19:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,7)\">Ps 19:7</ref> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>יצא</reflink></bdbheb> <b>1 f</b>); of man <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:25\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,25)\">2Sam 3:25</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מָבוֺא</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>דָּבָר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 9:25\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,25)\">Dan 9:25</ref> <highlight>going forth of a command.</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> concrete, <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵי גּוֺלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,4)\">Ezek 12:4</ref> <highlight>goings forth of</highlight> exile, i.e. <highlight>those going forth into</highlight> exile (in simile). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>way out, exit:</highlight> concrete, of chambers in temple <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,11)\">Ezek 42:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,11)\">Ezek 43:11</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מוֺבָאָיו</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵי הַמִּקְדָּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,5)\">Ezek 44:5</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מְבוֺא הַבַּיִת</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>that which goes forth:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>utteranc</highlight> of mouth or lips (especially of solemn or formal speech), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוֺצָא פִייֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,3)\">Deut 8:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׂפָתַי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,16)\">Jer 17:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,35)\">Ps 89:35</ref> so <ref ref=\"Deut 23:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,24)\">Deut 23:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,13)\">Num 30:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>export</highlight> of horses <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,23)\">1Kgs 10:23</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,16)\">2Chr 1:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>place of going forth:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>source</highlight> or <highlight>spring</highlight> of water <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,21)\">2Kgs 2:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 58:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,11)\">Isa 58:11</ref> (in simile) <ref ref=\"Ps 107:33\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,33)\">Ps 107:33</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נְהָרוֺת</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ps 107:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,35)\">Ps 107:35</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אֲגַםמֿים</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"Isa 41:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,18)\">Isa 41:18</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); <bdbheb>מוֺצָא מֵימֵי גִיחוֺן הָעֶלְיוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:30\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,30)\">2Chr 32:30</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>place of departure</highlight> of Israel on marchNum <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,2)\">2Chr 33:2</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>מוֺצָא</bdbheb> = east (place of sun's going forth) <ref ref=\"Ps 75:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,7)\">Ps 75:7</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מַעֲרָב</bdbheb>); zeugmatically, <ref ref=\"Ps 65:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,65,9)\">Ps 65:9</ref> <bdbheb>מוֺצָאֵי בֹּקֶר וָעֶרֶב</bdbheb> i.e. <highlight>the east and the west</highlight> (compare the <highlight>two Orients</highlight>, Qor 43:37). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> place whence silver comes = <highlight>mine</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 28:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,1)\">Job 28:1</ref> <bdbheb>וּלְהַצְמִיחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מֹצָא דֶשֶׁא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,27)\">Job 38:27</ref> and to cause the <highlight>growing-place</highlight> (others, <highlight>the growth</highlight>) of young grass to sprout. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 6:3", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 6, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Job 28:1", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 28, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 75:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 75, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Num 30:13", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 30, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Job 38:27", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 38, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Dan 9:25", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 9, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "2Sam 3:25", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ps 19:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 41:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ezek 43:11", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 43, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Num 33:2", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 33, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 42:11", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 42, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ezek 12:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 12, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 44:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 44, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut 8:3", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 8, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 17:16", "book": "JER", "chapter": 17, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 89:35", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "Deut 23:24", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 23, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "1Kgs 10:23", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 10, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "2Chr 1:16", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 1, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Kgs 2:21", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Isa 58:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 58, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 107:33", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 107, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Ps 107:35", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 107, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "2Chr 32:30", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 32, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "2Chr 33:2", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 33, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 65:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 65, "verse": 9}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מוֺצָא", "׳", "מ", "מֹצָא", "מוֺצָאֲךָ", "מֹצָאוֺ", "מוֺצָאוֺ", "מוֺצָאֵי", "מוֺצָאָיו", "מוֺצָאֵיהֶם", "מוֺצָאֵיהֶן", "י", "יצא", "מָבוֺא", "דָּבָר", "מוֺצָאֵי גּוֺלָה", "מוֺבָאָיו", "מוֺצָאֵי הַמִּקְדָּשׁ", "מְבוֺא